1 NAME Kanjeng Susuhunan PB II / RM. Gusti Prabu Suyasa
2 GIVN Kanjeng Susuhunan PB II / RM. Gusti Prabu Suyasa
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 8 DEC 1711
1 DEAT
